bWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Xh6CqeOjcalJs81Ktkb_cQ","review_id":"C-hoNc3WE4WdTFiHjOpIiA","date":"2010-10-11T01:47:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9235350489616394,"text_excerpt":"I like this spot, especially the location. Being so close to the highway, it's a convenient meeting place, and I usually find street parking. The bar food is pretty darn good if you're looking for cheesy, bacony waffle fries or a sandwich. Perfect greasy food for pre or post drinking. There are specials on week nights, and I especially like the Thursday's Ladies Night with free martinis after 9pm. The cajun martini is just like a bloody mary. And free tastes so good. I deducted a star because they could use a wider beer selection. I usually end up getting whatever the Abita seasonal offering is, which they usually have in bottles. I have seen small live bands there from time to time. Wish..."},{"business_id":"Xh6CqeOjcalJs81Ktkb_cQ","review_id":"3Gyqh9wutf5JZoUY8YVhbA","date":"2012-04-03T22:58:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9220733642578125,"text_excerpt":"I like this place. Not quite as good as when it first opened, but still a good place. Good burgers, inexpensive drinks, what more can u ask for. Not a fancy restaurant by any means, just corner bar with good food."},{"business_id":"Xh6CqeOjcalJs81Ktkb_cQ","review_id":"rzoRO2b7BaIzKXF0Iej90Q","date":"2013-08-02T15:56:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9216808676719666,"text_excerpt":"Great bar in the warehouse district. It has a \"regular\" crowd vibe because even on the weekend its not crazy crowded. People seem to come and grab a drink and go elsewhere. I come her mainly for one thing. The dirty fries. After a night of drinking its simply magical. They have a great DJ on Saturday nights and will play anything you request by Twitter."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Xh6CqeOjcalJs81Ktkb_cQ","photo_id":"ru-4SdCwSJi6h8dDA_kJ-Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ru-4SdCwSJi6h8dDA_kJ-Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8962404131889343},{"business_id":"Xh6CqeOjcalJs81Ktkb_cQ","photo_id":"fxvl_FaiC9P36U-HqNZgbA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/fxvl_FaiC9P36U-HqNZgbA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8852076530456543},{"business_id":"Xh6CqeOjcalJs81Ktkb_cQ","photo_id":"3yDLZAgoDdKiRlJUhmPYtw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/3yDLZAgoDdKiRlJUhmPYtw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.816863477230072}]},"notebook_case":null}
